{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#card-zh","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-chat 是面向 DSH Web 的跨实例会话与消息协作插件。它将 peer 工具注册到 DSH，并在网页侧栏提供对话面板；对端可按名字或端口定位，token 可从配置、启动日志或缓存中解析。用户可以向本机或远端会话发送消息、等待回答、在当前回合插话、查看最近回复，也能把多个对端步骤串成可保存和复用的链路。面板支持选择对端和模式、编辑链路及导入导出。远端交互通过 loopback HTTP 完成；需配置对端 URL 与 home，或提供 PEER_TOKEN，使用 Node.js 22.15 以上版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2126-2132","index.js:2196-2209","index.js:1195-1225","index.js:1864-1885","client.js:504-523"]}
{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#card-en","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peer-chat connects DSH instances through tools and a sidebar. Send messages, wait for replies, steer sessions, inspect output, or chain steps. Peers use names or ports; tokens come from settings, logs, or cache. Remote chat uses HTTP. Set peer details or PEER_TOKEN. Requires Node.js 22.15+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2126-2132","index.js:2196-2209","index.js:1195-1225","index.js:1864-1885","client.js:504-523"]}
