{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#feature-1","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-chat 的功能「跨实例问答」：peer_ask 可按名称或端口连接远端 DSH，自动解析 token、创建或续接会话、投递消息并轮询回复；也可使用 self 目标走本机会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:889-944","index.js:1010-1017"]}
{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#feature-2","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-chat 的功能「多步对端链路」：peer_chain 按步骤将消息发给多个实例，把前序回复作为后续上下文，并可保存链路、设置模式和失败时是否停止。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1195-1240","index.js:2275-2350","index.js:2587-2698"]}
{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#feature-3","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-chat 的功能「跨端侧栏面板」：Web 侧栏可发现或选择对端、查看模式、发送消息，并编辑、运行、导入或导出多步链路。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:90-120","client.js:285-365","client.js:504-523"]}
{"unit_id":"Kewnn__dsh-peer-chat#caveat-1","repo":"Kewnn/dsh-peer-chat","commit":"182159b3565faf96e27c0bc88b5a0fe2da756fe0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peer-chat 使用前须知：跨实例消息会经 HTTP 发给所选 DSH 对端；插件使用对端 web token 登录，并从对端会话日志读取回复。需配置 peer URL/home 或可发现的 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:423-435","index.js:889-944"]}
